### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Database Readiness
GET http://localhost:8080/ready

### Register Source Connection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Source MySQL",
    "db_type": "mysql",
    "host": "localhost",
    "port": 3306,
    "database": "source_db",
    "username": "migration_user",
    "password": "source_password_123"
}

### List Connections
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections

### Get Connection
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections/1

### Delete Connection
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections/1